Subject: [PATCH 9/9] virtio-gpu: virglrenderer backend (virgl + venus
 capsets), blob resources, backend selection

---
 src/devices/virtio-gpu.c | 761 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 src/devices/virtio-gpu.h |  15 +
